! ### The typeclasses
- The same call reads a record from an `Expanse`, such as a `Terrain` of memory-mapped bytes,
- at a `Long` offset. Only the record's own bytes are read from it.
+ The same call reads a record from an `Expanse`, such as a `Terrain` of memory-mapped bytes,
+ at a `Long` offset. Only the record's own bytes are read from it.

